，未可以武服也。冒頓殺父代立，妻群母，以力為威，未可以仁義說也。獨可以計久遠子孫為臣耳，然恐陛下不能為。」上曰：「誠可，何為不能！顧為柰何？」劉敬對曰：「陛下誠能以適長公主妻之，厚奉遺之，彼知漢適女送厚，蠻夷必慕以為閼氏，生子必為太子。代單于。何者？貪漢重幣。陛下以歲時漢所餘彼所鮮數問遺，因使辯士風諭以禮節。冒頓在，固為子婿；死，則外孫為單于。豈嘗聞外孫敢與大父抗禮者哉？兵可無戰以漸臣也。若陛下不能遣長公主，而令宗室及後宮詐稱公主，彼亦知，不肯貴近，無益也。」高帝曰：「善。」欲遣長公主。呂后日夜泣，曰：「妾唯太子、一女，柰何棄之匈奴！」上竟不能遣長公主，而取家人子名為長公主，妻單于。使劉敬往結和親約。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-099-liushu:m006-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"高帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-099-liushu:m006-0007","start":7,"end":10,"surface":"韓王信","kind":"person","person_id":"hm1_rqr_l9u","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-099-liushu:m006-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"冒頓","kind":"person","person_id":"wjt_htu_081_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-099-liushu:m006-0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"劉敬","kind":"person","person_id":"e5s_bwt_y45","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-099-liushu:m006-0046","start":46,"end":48,"surface":"劉敬","kind":"person","person_id":"e5s_bwt_y45","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-099-liushu:m006-0069","start":69,"end":71,"surface":"冒頓","kind":"person","person_id":"wjt_htu_081_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-099-liushu:m006-0072","start":72,"end":73,"surface":"父","kind":"person","person_id":"krx_d9v_3wv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-099-liushu:m006-0077","start":77,"end":79,"surface":"群母","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、合稱或待辨稱名；和親條件及建議中的未來子孫不當實際人物。"},{"id":"c-shiji-099-liushu:m006-0132","start":132,"end":134,"surface":"劉敬","kind":"person","person_id":"e5s_bwt_y45","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-099-liushu:m006-0143","start":143,"end":147,"surface":"適長公主","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AI","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-099-liushu:m006-0176","start":176,"end":178,"surface":"太子","k